  gaokun3 rescue system  (Debian 13, changes are kept in RAM only)

  This is not an installed system: the root is a read-only squashfs with a
  tmpfs overlay, and changes are lost on reboot. The boot medium is mounted
  at /media/gk3.

  Partition and file system tools: sgdisk parted resize2fs mkfs.* simg2img
  Install Android:      bash -c '. /usr/share/gaokun3/installer-lib.sh && gk3_preflight'
  Boot an Android slot next time: gk3-boot-android a|b [--reboot]  (--list shows the entries)
  Boot evidence:        /media/gk3/gaokun3/diag/  (written by gk3-diag 45 s after boot)
